SKUNKPORT: experimental, untested on HDXI. Wayland only (the X11 backend is patched out) and
linked without libGL: it needs the mesa skunkport at runtime for EGL (software rendering or
virgl, or whatever GL your mesa build supports). Needs Go (devel-go, about 70 MB download).
The build downloads Go modules from the network and takes a long time. Unsupported; may break.
